# =============================================================================
# @file api.Dockerfile.dockerignore
# @path deploy/docker/api.Dockerfile.dockerignore
# @project JS web-platform
# @author JS
# @created 2026
# @description Build context of api.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to
#   the Dockerfile). Allow-list: only the code of the API, the image files of deploy/docker and
#   the deployment bundle (compose.prod.yaml, vps/deploy.sh) -
#   never .env, keys, vendor/ of the developer, uploads, logs or tests. From storage/ only the
#   base translations (storage/app/public/translations - the seed of a new installation).
# =============================================================================
*
!api/app
!api/artisan
!api/bootstrap
!api/composer.json
!api/composer.lock
!api/config
!api/database
!api/public
!api/resources
!api/routes
!api/storage/app/public/translations
!deploy/docker/php
!deploy/docker/api-entrypoint.sh
!deploy/compose.prod.yaml
!deploy/vps/deploy.sh
api/bootstrap/cache/*.php
api/public/storage
api/public/hot
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
